# PointFive Design System — UI

When building or editing pages and components for this site:

## Border radius
- **Use minimal radius.** Prefer `rounded-sm` (4px) for cards, containers, buttons, and panels.
- **Avoid** `rounded-xl`, `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-3xl`, and large custom radii — they conflict with the intended minimal aesthetic.
- **Reserve `rounded-full`** only for true circles: avatars, pill badges, decorative blurs, and step-number circles.
- Global theme tokens in `app/globals.css` are set to minimal values (`--radius-sm` through `--radius-xl`); use them or explicit `rounded-sm` for consistency.

## Reference
- Radius tokens: `app/globals.css` (`--radius`, `--radius-sm`, etc.)
- Card default: `components/ui/card.tsx` uses `rounded-sm`
